ext-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 翔龙瞬闪突.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/63/i0ahtvwn3i22xriarzhy04n1hp6keeo.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%BF%94%E9%BE%99%E7%9E%AC%E9%97%AA%E7%AA%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/63/i0ahtvwn3i22xriarzhy04n1hp6keeo.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%BF%94%E9%BE%99%E7%9E%AC%E9%97%AA%E7%AA%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/63/i0ahtvwn3i22xriarzhy04n1hp6keeo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />翔龙瞬闪突•改\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>4-4十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>4纵内\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）选择自身十字范围内<font color=\"red\">1</font>个地点，冲锋至该地点并对沿路所有敌人，造成<font color=\"red\">80%</font>伤害，冲锋无视阻挡。攻击后，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 4-4十字 4纵内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/51/fjlbslwmk3fegb1wp2qon79q3r631c9.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_4-4%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_4%E7%BA%B5%E5%86%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/51/fjlbslwmk3fegb1wp2qon79q3r631c9.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9B%E9%95%BF%E6%9E%AA%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/王国军长枪兵\"><img alt=\"头像 王国军长枪兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/dc/igcoh274lu33eizv8yuswufc3ql2jmf.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">王国军长枪兵</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%E6%8A%95%E6%9E%AA%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/法皇国投枪兵\"><img alt=\"头像 法皇国投枪兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d1/chy2j65mmje4u1q8zgphtsniqdjx1nc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" styl